      "final_text": "Implemented `solve(payload, config)` in `/Volumes/Models/ds4/.workspaces/server-agent-day-20261004/confirmation-visible/lru/solution.py`.\n\nIt uses an insertion-ordered dict as the LRU list (least-recent first, most-recent last):\n- Hits move the key to most-recently-used.\n- Misses insert as most-recently-used and evict the least-recently-used key when capacity is exceeded, appending it to `evictions`.\n- `capacity <= 0` yields all misses, zero hits, and empty `cache`/`evictions`.\n- Keys are compared exactly, empty keys are preserved, and neither `payload` nor `config` is mutated.\n\nFor the sample (`capacity: 2`, accesses `a, b, a, c, b, d`), the result is `cache: [\"b\", \"d\"]`, `hits: 1`, `misses: 5`, `evictions: [\"a\", \"c\", \"b\"]`.",
